Gem Hunt: ten gems are buried near you. Dig them out in three minutes.
The first is four blocks straight down. Gems glow; the top of the screen says how far the nearest is.
keys: click or X dig, right-click or E place, 1-8 choose the block (7 water, 8 a lamp), N night or day, W A S D walk, Space jump, F fly, drag or arrows look, H home, q quit
G: give up
